'''Event Capsule Cats''' are [[Cat Units]] that can be unlocked by playing the Event Capsule. Most Event Capsules have their own exclusive units, although a few can be obtained through other means. Notably, they are the only [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] that can upgrade to + levels, though that + level cap varies depending on the Unit.

